  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "Given equation: (18 × 2) – 24 + 10 × 160 ÷ 16 + (10 × 4) = 170\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 2 and 24 \n\nGiven: (18 × 2) – 24 + 10 × 160 ÷ 16 + (10 × 4) = 170\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ (__**18 × 24**__) – 2 + 10 × 160 ÷ 16 + (__**10 × 4**__) = 170\n\n⇒ 432 – 2 + 10 × __**160 ÷ 16**__ + 40 = 170\n\n⇒ 432 – 2 + __**10 × 10**__ + 40 = 170\n\n⇒ __**432**__ – 2 __**+ 100 + 40**__ = 170\n\n⇒ __**572 - 2**__ ≠ 170\n\n⇒ 570 ≠ 170\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) 2 and 4 \n\nGiven: (18 × 2) – 24 + 10 × 160 ÷ 16 + (10 × 4) = 170\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ (__**18 × 4**__) – 24 + 10 × 160 ÷ 16 + (__**10 × 2**__) = 170\n\n⇒ 72 – 24 + 10 × __**160 ÷ 16**__ + 20 = 170\n\n⇒ 72 – 24 + __**10 × 10**__ + 20 = 170\n\n⇒ __**72**__ – 24 __**+ 100 + 20**__ = 170\n\n⇒ __**19**____**2 – 24**__ = 170\n\n⇒ 168 = 170\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) **24 and 18**\n\nGiven: (18 × 2) – 24 + 10 × 160 ÷ 16 + (10 × 4) = 170\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ (__**24 × 2**__) – 18 + 10 × 160 ÷ 16 + (__**10 × 4**__) = 170\n\n⇒ 48 – 18 + 10 × __**160 ÷ 16**__ + 40 = 170\n\n⇒ 48 – 18 + __**10 × 10**__ + 40 = 170\n\n⇒ __**48**__ – 18 __**+ 100 + 40**__ = 170\n\n⇒ __188** – 18**__ = 170\n\n⇒ **170** = 170\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 4) 16 and 18\n\nGiven: (18 × 2) – 24 + 10 × 160 ÷ 16 + (10 × 4) = 170\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ (__**16 × 2**__) – 24 + 10 × 160 ÷ 18 + (__**10 × 4**__) = 170\n\n⇒ 32 – 24 + 10 × __**160 ÷ 18**__ + 40 = 170\n\n⇒ 32 – 24 + __**10 × 18.88**__ + 40 = 170\n\n⇒ __**32**__ – 24 __**+ 188.8 + 40**__ = 170\n\n⇒ __260.8** – 24**__ = 170\n\n⇒ 236.8 ≠ 170\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
